<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.failure-terminal apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NK1M9ER6XN2B5HHG04VF>
  Provider completion 失败时 delegate 应以何种终态返回？
  </?01M1B0NK1M9ER6XN2B5HHG04VF>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NK1PNEXRTJVZWB244FKK>
    失败必须失败，不能 completed 后返回空字符串。
    </?01M1B0NK1PNEXRTJVZWB244FKK>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NK1PNEXRTJVZWB244FKM>
    Provider failure SHALL terminate the delegate and parent workflow tool as structured failure。
    </?01M1B0NK1PNEXRTJVZWB244FKM>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E5>
    terminal state 是控制面 authority，不能与 effect evidence 矛盾。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E5>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E6>
    事故 session 与 AiAgentExecutor provider_failed 分支。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E6>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.result-authority apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E7>
  Orchestrator 从哪里派生 child 输出？
  </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E7>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E8>
    Conversation Domain 是 single in-memory truth。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E8>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E9>
    所有 delegate completion 分支 SHALL 从 Conversation Domain materialization 派生输出，compatibility mirror 只读且不拥有结果 authority。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83E9>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EA>
    避免不同 driver 分支读取不同事实源并产生空结果。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EA>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EB>
    DelegateActor 注释与 driverRuntime 当前实现冲突。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EB>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.tool-call-identity apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EC>
  并行 tool-call identity 缺失或冲突时是否允许猜测合并？
  </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EC>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83ED>
    不允许静默拼接工具名和参数。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83ED>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EE>
    Adapter 只能依据明确 provider contract 做 normalization；否则返回结构化 protocol failure。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EE>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EF>
    错误工具调用比显式失败更危险且难以恢复。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EF>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EG>
    事故中两组同名并行工具被重复拼接。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EG>
  )>
)>

<decision #track.harden-ai-workflow-agent-runtime.stage-outcome apiVersion="codument.tech/v1alpha1" { priority = "P0" status = "accepted" durable_candidate = true } (
  <question ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EH>
  怎样防止 workflow actor 在没有产物时持续探索十余分钟？
  </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EH>
  <answer {  } (
    <raw-answer ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EJ>
    按 KWF 的有限产品阶段，每轮必须有结构化进展，修复循环和 provider retry 都受产品 deadline 约束。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EJ>
    <decision-text ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EK>
    Every workflow actor turn SHALL produce a non-empty structured stage outcome or native tool effect; proof repair SHALL be bounded and the product stage deadline SHALL cap provider retries。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EK>
    <rationale ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EM>
    provider timeout 不是用户旅程预算；只有可观测 transition 才能证明产品在前进。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EM>
    <evidence ?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EN>
    事故 session 十一分钟无 workspace mutation；KWF structured scaffold/infer and bounded model E2E。
    </?01M1B0NK1QC9C3XJ7FQ28P83EN>
  )>
)>
